- 相关工具/路径：`unity_operation_validate/start/wait`；`F:\xclient2\Log\ProjectileEditor\StartupSmoke\20260909_001828_319_64ce01c3\report.json`；项目双向引用 `F:\xclient2\TODO_UPilot.mcd` / “Operation 产物收集器应区分路径与哈希标量”。
